    },
    {
      "displayText": "향수 만들기를\n또 도와주셨으면 해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D5A5C2180020B9CCB4E4AE30B97C000AB6100020B3C4C640C8FCC168C73CBA740020D574C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번에는 오케이징의 새카만 먹물을\n활용해 보고 싶어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC88C5D0B2940020C624CF00C774C9D5C7580020C0C8CE74B9CC0020BA39BB3CC744000AD65CC6A9D5740020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5B4C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니 이번에도 부탁드릴게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C80020C774BC88C5D0B3C40020BD80D0C1B4DCB9B4AC8CC694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮으시다면 오케이징을\n데려와 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD1CCC2EC73CC2DCB2E4BA740020C624CF00C774C9D5C744000AB370B824C6400020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오케이징을 지닌 포켓몬에 넣고\n데려와 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624CF00C774C9D5C7440020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE0000AB370B824C6400020C8FCC138C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오케이징을 데려와 주셨군요!\n감사합니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624CF00C774C9D5C7440020B370B824C6400020C8FCC168AD70C6940021000AAC10C0ACD569B2C8B2E4002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼 바로 오케이징의 먹물을\n조금만 실례할게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC0020BC14B85C0020C624CF00C774C9D5C7580020BA39BB3CC744000AC870AE08B9CC0020C2E4B840D560AC8CC694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와!\n생각한 것보다 훨씬 새카맣네요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6400021000AC0DDAC01D55C0020AC83BCF4B2E40020D6E8C52C0020C0C8CE74B9E3B124C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼 향수를 만들어 봐야겠어요!\n금방 다녀올게요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC0020D5A5C218B97C0020B9CCB4E4C5B40020BD10C57CACA0C5B4C6940021000AAE08BC290020B2E4B140C62CAC8CC694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오케이징 향수가\n완성됐어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624CF00C774C9D50020D5A5C218AC00000AC644C131B410C5B4C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바닷바람이 스쳐 지나가는 듯한\n이 상쾌함...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그야말로 오메이징한 향기인데요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B2F7BC14B78CC7740020C2A4CCD00020C9C0B098AC00B2940020B4EFD55C000AC7740020C0C1CF8CD568002E002E002E00100001BE00000AADF8C57CB9D0B85C0020C624BA54C774C9D5D55C0020D5A5AE30C778B370C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데, 약간의 문제가 있어요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B370002C0020C57DAC04C7580020BB38C81CAC000020C788C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "바로 향기가\n식욕을 마구마구 자극한다는 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC14B85C0020D5A5AE30AC00000AC2DDC695C7440020B9C8AD6CB9C8AD6C0020C790ADF9D55CB2E4B2940020AC70C608C694002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "활용할 방법이 전혀 없지는 않겠지만,\n상품으로 팔기는 어려울 것 같네요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D65CC6A9D5600020BC29BC95C7740020C804D6000020C5C6C9C0B2940020C54AACA0C9C0B9CC002C000AC0C1D488C73CB85C0020D314AE30B2940020C5B4B824C6B80020AC830020AC19B124C694002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래도, 엄청난 향수를 만들 수 있었으니...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798B3C4002C0020C5C4CCADB09C0020D5A5C218B97C0020B9CCB4E40020C2180020C788C5C8C73CB2C8002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "만사 오케이징이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9CCC0AC0020C624CF00C774C9D5C774C5D0C694002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
